Third-party material in this repository
=======================================

The LICENSE file covers the code and text written for this project. The material below keeps its
own licence.

1. Chess pieces
   Files: assets/pieces/*.svg, and the same images inlined as data URIs in index.html.
   The "cburnett" chess piece set by Colin M.L. Burnett, published on Wikimedia Commons under a
   choice of the GFDL, the BSD licence and the GPL. It is used here under the BSD licence.

2. Game data
   File: games.json.
   Derived from the Lichess open database (https://database.lichess.org/), standard rated games,
   October 2026, which Lichess releases under CC0 (public domain dedication). Player names and
   other identifying fields were dropped during extraction.
